* Two PSBs in one source: one that reads, one that updates, and an
* I/O PCB. The second has no PSBGEN name and takes the file's.
ORDPCB   PCB   TYPE=DB,DBDNAME=ORDERDB,PROCOPT=G,KEYLEN=11              
         SENSEG NAME=ORDER,PARENT=0                                     
         SENSEG NAME=ORDLINE,PARENT=ORDER                               
         PSBGEN LANG=COBOL,PSBNAME=ORDREAD                              
         PCB   TYPE=TP,MODIFY=YES                                       
         PCB   TYPE=DB,ORDERDB,PROCOPT=A,KEYLEN=11                      
         SENSEG ORDER,0                                                 
         SENSEG ORDNOTE,ORDER                                           
